      "evidence": "self.headers = {\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\"}",
      "llm_reasoning": "The token is stored in an instance variable without protection, and there is no mechanism to mask or clear it, increasing the risk of accidental logging or exposure in memory dumps.",
